                            <div class="buffer-zone bg-green-500/80" id="green-zone" style="height: 31.4%;"></div>
                            <div id="net-flow-indicator-wrapper" class="absolute w-full h-full bottom-0">
                                <div id="net-flow-indicator" class="absolute w-full h-1 bg-blue-700 -ml-2" style="bottom: 56.14%;">
                                    <div class="absolute -right-2 -top-2 w-4 h-4 rounded-full bg-blue-700"></div>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                        <div class="text-left">
                             <h4 class="font-bold text-lg mb-4">버퍼 레벨 개요</h4>
                            <div class="flex items-center space-x-3 mb-2">
                                <div class="w-4 h-4 rounded bg-green-500"></div>
                                <span class="font-medium">Green Zone (최대 재고): <span id="green-val">140</span></span>
                            </div>
                            <div class="flex items-center space-x-3 mb-2">
                                <div class="w-4 h-4 rounded bg-yellow-500"></div>
                                <span class="font-medium">Yellow Zone (재주문점): <span id="yellow-val">200</span></span>
                            </div>
                            <div class="flex items-center space-x-3 mb-2">
                                <div class="w-4 h-4 rounded bg-red-500"></div>
                                <span class="font-medium">Red Zone (안전 재고): <span id="red-val">75</span></span>
                            </div>
                             <div class="border-t my-4"></div>
                             <p class="text-lg font-bold">총 버퍼 크기: <span id="total-buffer">415</span></p>
                             <p id="bufferStatus" class="mt-4 text-lg font-bold h-12"></p>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </section>

        <!-- Section 4: Impact -->
        <section id="impact" class="scroll-mt-20">
            <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold text-center mb-4 text-gray-800">기대 효과: 무엇이 달라질까요?</h2>
             <p class="max-w-3xl mx-auto text-center text-gray-600 mb-12">
                DDMRP 도입은 단순한 기능 개선을 넘어, 기업의 핵심 경쟁력을 강화하는 전략적 혁신입니다. 실제 도입 기업들의 사례를 바탕으로 한 정량적 기대 효과는 다음과 같습니다.
            </p>
            <div class="bg-white p-8 rounded-xl shadow-lg">
                <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4 gap-8">
                    <div class="text-center">
                        <h4 class="font-bold text-lg text-gray-700">재고 수준</h4>
                        <p class="text-4xl font-bold text-green-600 my-2">30-45%↓</p>
                        <p class="text-sm text-gray-500">과잉 재고를 방지하고<br>운영 비용을 절감합니다.</p>
                    </div>
                    <div class="text-center">
                        <h4 class="font-bold text-lg text-gray-700">납기 준수율</h4>
                        <p class="text-4xl font-bold text-blue-600 my-2">99%↑</p>
                        <p class="text-sm text-gray-500">고객 만족도와<br>신뢰도를 향상시킵니다.</p>
                    </div>
                    <div class="text-center">
                        <h4 class="font-bold text-lg text-gray-700">결품률</h4>
                        <p class="text-4xl font-bold text-green-600 my-2">60-80%↓</p>
                        <p class="text-sm text-gray-500">판매 기회 손실을<br>최소화합니다.</p>
                    </div>
                    <div class="text-center">
                        <h4 class="font-bold text-lg text-gray-700">계획 수립 시간</h4>
                        <p class="text-4xl font-bold text-blue-600 my-2">50%+↓</p>
                        <p class="text-sm text-gray-500">불필요한 재계획을 줄여<br>업무 효율성을 높입니다.</p>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="mt-12">
                     <div class="chart-container" style="height: 300px; max-height: 350px;">
                        <canvas id="impactChart"></canvas>
