                </div>
            </div>
        </section>
    </main>

    <footer class="bg-white mt-16 border-t">
        <div class="container mx-auto px-6 py-4 text-center text-gray-500">
            <p>&copy; 2025 공사다망 팀. All Rights Reserved.</p>
        </div>
